      "id": "third-eye",
      "title": "Third eye",
      "description": "Medical Report plays a very important role in the cure of any disease. But if the medical history of a patient is way big and handwritten, it is hard for anyone to extract the required information from them. 'Third Eye' allows doctors to get managed information about the medical history of the patient. Doctors will get a platform to write medical reports in an electric medium, allowing them to manage their appointments with patients so the risky and unsecured traditional paper file method will be replaced. Additionally, Third Eye will allow users to print their medical reports in hard and or soft copy it will be easy to extract and share only the required part. The records will be grouped categorically. Doctors will be allowed to comment or write reviews on old reports so that old reports may also be used to explain the new issues. Patients will also be able to log in and access their medical history and status.",
